<title>HONG KONG: China Foods changes fiscal year end date.</title>
<headline>China Foods changes fiscal year end date.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Foods Holdings Ltd said on Friday it would change its fiscal year end date to December 31 from March 31 in order to be coterminous with the company's subsidiaries in China.</p>
<p>The company said the directors &quot;beleive that the change in the financial year end will not distort the company's results.&quot;</p>
<p>China Foods is controlled by state-owned China National Cereals  Oil and Foodstuffs Import and Export Corp (Ceroil).</p>
<p>Its shares rose HK$0.06 or 5.36 percent to HK$1.19 in late trade on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
